      "notes": [
        "1. Item 1 is cut and engraved from the KC-01-1041 production file of the same revision.",
        "2. Items 2 and 4 are complete modules to their own drawing packages (KC-01-1910, KC-01-1860). The Resource Display is the panel hub: its CN1 goes to Ctrl Module Extension CN5; Info Display 2 plugs into its slot P2 and the Dual Encoder into slot P4 (Hardware Reference §4.4).",
        "3. The Dual Encoder's encoders pass through the two Ø7.6 holes under the CTRL GRP and EXT CAM legends.",
        "4. All sheets at 2:5 on A3. Parts list on sheet 3."
